{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00894","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 黄雀行 · 庄南杰","name":"鼓吹曲辞 黄雀行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穿屋穿墙不知止，争树争巢入营死。\n林间公子挟弹弓，一丸致毙花丛里。\n小雏黄口未有知，青天不解高高飞。\n虞人设网当要路，白日啾嘲祸万机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庄南杰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}